    "description": "Data originates from a collection of different tissue samples of dead Antarctic\nfur seals, including some seals found on beaches of the Cape. Tissue samples\nwere  collected for the purpose of studying histopatologies. The analysis of\nthe samples will  determine the possible cause of death, as well as foster\nstudy in any diseases from which  the animal may have suffered.",
